author ai
group gui
note How the panels around the centre are placed, resized and moved. Three panels (Paths/Symbols/Files, Xrefs, Output) each sit on one edge of the window - left, right or bottom - in an order along that edge and at a size across it. The layout is one list of places, read every frame: the frame asks for every size first, clamped so the centre stays usable, then draws each edge's panels in list order with a splitter on the centre side. Dragging a splitter puts the panel's inner edge under the pointer; pressing a panel's header and dragging shows a band where it would land and moves it there on release. Nothing is saved: a launch starts from the default layout.

