symbol sizes
lines 0 22
hash 639ed9f607617c77
note Called after dock_input, before any panel is drawn. Each axis in turn: side panels share the window width with a 20-column centre, bottom panels share the height with 12 rows of top bar, centre and status bar. Each panel gets what it asks for, clamped to a floor and to what is left after the floors of the panels after it. The stored size is never touched here, so a panel squeezed by a small window, or by a wide neighbour, grows back when there is room again.

