file src/gui/dock.rs
symbol move_to
lines 0 17
hash 41b318d30c4edfd9
note Removes the place and inserts it before the at-th panel of the new edge, or at the end of the list. A panel changing between a side and the bottom loses its size, which measured the other axis; a panel moving between left and right keeps its width.

