file src/gui/dock.rs
symbol dock_input
lines 0 33
hash eba2e266e2123343
note Called by the frame right after the element tree begins, before any size is read, so a drag shows in the frame it happens and a click after a drop is hit-tested against the new layout. A held splitter puts its panel's inner edge under the pointer, from last frame's rectangle of the panel, so the edge follows the pointer with no drift from summing per-frame deltas. A held header arms once the pointer has travelled; released, it moves the panel if it was armed and the pointer is over a target, and otherwise just lets go.

