hash 676587376c5fe6d7
note The bar between a panel and the centre. It is several pixels wide so it is easy to catch, but only the line beside the panel shows; the rest is the centre's colour. Hovered or held it turns accent-coloured and asks for a resize cursor, except while another drag holds the mouse. The resizing itself is dock_input's.
